Compression Metric

Define

* C(x) = compressed representation
* R(C) = reconstruction
* I(x) = semantic information

A useful compression maximizes

J
=
\frac{
I(R(C(x)))
}{
|C(x)|
}

High-quality operators have large semantic density.

